DESCRIPTION:Conestoga Valley Democrats is looking for volunteers for Elect
 ion Day poll observers and greeters. The poll observer’s role is to watc
 h and report any irregularities\, without directly interfering with electi
 on workers or voters. The greeters inform people who come to vote\, answer
  any questions\, and hand out the “Voted” stickers. Shifts could be: -
  all day - half day (morning) - half day (afternoon / evening) - peak hour
 s 7-9am\; - peak hours 9am-12pm\; - peak hours 12-2pm\; - peak hours 2pm-5
 pm\; - 
LOCATION:A Polling Place Near You\, 123 A Polling Place Near You\, Lancast
 er\, PA\, 17602
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/1056526/
